{
  "work_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt",
  "source_path": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt.json",
  "source_language": "oge",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.17",
      "source_sha256": "2acb618a7861c87a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now tell us, what do you think: is it lawful to give tribute to Caesar, or not?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.18",
      "source_sha256": "633a5c2483af600b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus perceived their wickedness and said to them, \"Why do you test me, you hypocrites?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.19",
      "source_sha256": "56b7a88320f881a5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Show me the coin of the tribute!\" And they brought him a denarius."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.20",
      "source_sha256": "bf32f1cf54f42074",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus said to them, \"Whose is this image and inscription?\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.21",
      "source_sha256": "9c72c0e59759c948",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They said to him, \"Caesar's.\" Then Jesus said to them, \"Give to Caesar what is Caesar's, and to God what is God's.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.22",
      "source_sha256": "40aecb7fb0ff8c12",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when they heard this, they were amazed, and they left him and went away."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.23",
      "source_sha256": "2c2b6828942b8398",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "On that day the Sadducees, who say that there is no resurrection, came to him and asked him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.24",
      "source_sha256": "aa66008d544087c3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "saying, \"Teacher, Moses said this: If anyone dies and has no child, his brother shall marry his wife and raise up offspring for his brother."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.25",
      "source_sha256": "c751d27fc1cee8d3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "There were among us seven brothers. The first married and died, and no offspring remained, and he left his wife to his brother."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.26",
      "source_sha256": "f874fad53827d8bb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise the second and the third, up to the seventh."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.27",
      "source_sha256": "39a9b1da3acc1f48",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Last of all, the woman also died."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.28",
      "source_sha256": "458badeed8defe3d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now then, in the resurrection, whose wife of the seven will she be? For they all had her.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.29",
      "source_sha256": "aa55788fd5c0a693",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus answered and said to them, \"You are mistaken, because you know neither the Scriptures nor the power of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.30",
      "source_sha256": "612ab8fa8943a876",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For in the resurrection they neither marry nor are given in marriage, but they are like the angels in heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.31",
      "source_sha256": "9ab218429ffb376b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And concerning the resurrection of the dead, have you not read what was spoken by God, who says:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.32",
      "source_sha256": "f2a88cb8c3456745",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'I am the God of Abraham and the God of Isaac and the God of Jacob'? He is not the God of the dead, but of the living.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.33",
      "source_sha256": "4aa291baef0d2c63",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when the crowd heard this, they were astonished at his teaching."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.34",
      "source_sha256": "5738298f9f409202",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But when the Pharisees heard that he had silenced the Sadducees, they gathered together."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.35",
      "source_sha256": "bc9d3920a806eee9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And one of them asked him, testing him:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.36",
      "source_sha256": "28db2b9ec1dbc29e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"Teacher, which commandment is the greatest in the Law?\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.37",
      "source_sha256": "0290417a901d9552",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And Jesus said to him, \"You shall love the Lord your God with all your heart and with all your soul and with all your mind."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.38",
      "source_sha256": "39929d9c01bc9ab8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is the great and first commandment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.39",
      "source_sha256": "81ab62a6e97f20ba",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And the second is like it: You shall love your neighbour as yourself."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.40",
      "source_sha256": "1c9738c1b42c53d7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "On these two commandments hang all the Law and the Prophets.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-preathonite-gospels/matt#Matt.22.41",
      "source_sha256": "9853f4dfe8b21933",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "While the Pharisees were gathered together, Jesus asked them,"
    }
  ]
}
